WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.300
Plant and animal cells share three parts; plant cells add more.

2
00:00:05.001 --> 00:00:09.451
Every cell has a nucleus, a cell membrane and cytoplasm.

3
00:00:12.408 --> 00:00:16.158
The nucleus holds the DNA, the cell's instructions.

4
00:00:19.141 --> 00:00:23.191
Plant cells add chloroplasts, which capture light to make food.

5
00:00:24.017 --> 00:00:27.842
Plant cells also have a cell wall and a large vacuole.
